      "id": "claim_3be995ddda524322b7877516e15f62a9",
      "statement": "Targeting is explicit and per-call, carried in the envelope target (browserInstanceId and tabId) rather than hidden session state; when tabId is provided the extension resolves that specific tab, and when omitted it falls back to the active foreground tab. There is no session-level selected-tab default.",
