      "id": "claim_20ef42a5fd3c4131a14ed9595470e945",
      "statement": "BrowserCapability is a closed union of 16 named feature flags (page_context, page_content, click, fill_input, fill_editable, set_checked, select_options, submit_form, navigate, batch, upload_file, download_status, download_file, fetch_resource, screenshot) matching protocol payload types; isBrowserCapability validates each entry against this union.",
