      "id": "claim_d20c89de31454986b1d6180bf5fec955",
      "statement": "Screenshots (ADR 0064) are an explicit capture_screenshot request backed by the 'screenshot' capability, returning viewport-only JPEG data (dataBase64, width, height, tabId, capturedAt) from the visible tab; errors use ScreenshotErrorCode (capability_not_supported, capture_failed, no_visible_tab, timeout). Active-tab-only because chrome.tabs.captureVisibleTab captures only the visible tab.",
